{"id": 63456, "date": "2025-12-28T04:00:46", "date_gmt": "2025-12-28T12:00:46", "guid": {"rendered": "https://estreetshuffle.com/?p=63456"}, "modified": "2026-08-29T14:52:15", "modified_gmt": "2026-08-29T21:52:15", "slug": "kingdom-of-days-december-28-2", "status": "publish", "type": "post", "link": "https://estreetshuffle.com/index.php/2025/12/28/kingdom-of-days-december-28-2/", "title": {"rendered": "December 28"}, "content": {"rendered": "<p><strong>1968:\u00a0</strong>Earth plays to their largest crowd yet at the Crystal Ballroom in New York City&#8217;s Hotel Diplomat, but the show almost doesn&#8217;t happen. One week out, not even 100 tickets had been sold for this fundraiser in an 1,800-seat ballroom, but the administration of Ocean County College contributed funds and transportation to help drive attendance and support their students who organized the event.</p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"6757\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/1968-1228/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1968-1228.jpg?fit=220%2C751&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"220,751\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"1968-1228\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1968-1228.jpg?fit=220%2C751&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-6757 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1968-1228.jpg?resize=220%2C751&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"220\" height=\"751\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1968-1228.jpg?w=220&amp;ssl=1 220w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1968-1228.jpg?resize=88%2C300&amp;ssl=1 88w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 220px) 100vw, 220px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>1973:\u00a0</strong>Bruce and the E Street Band play two shows on their second of four nights at The Main Point in Bryn Mawr, Pennsylvania.</p>\n<p><strong>1975:\u00a0</strong>On their second of a four-night stand at Philadelphia&#8217;s Tower Theater, Bruce and the band open with a new arrangement of &#8220;Tenth Avenue Freeze-Out&#8221; and play &#8220;Sha La La&#8221; for the last time for 34 years. It would appear that this year-end stand was hastily booked, as a mere four days ago Toronto press was aggressively promoting Bruce&#8217;s scheduled appearance on this date at Seneca college.</p>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Z9CHbbvogto?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"55417\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/the_north_york_mirror_1975_12_24_18/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/The_North_York_Mirror_1975_12_24_18-scaled.jpg?fit=2560%2C978&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"2560,978\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"The_North_York_Mirror_1975_12_24_18\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/The_North_York_Mirror_1975_12_24_18-scaled.jpg?fit=758%2C289&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-55417 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/The_North_York_Mirror_1975_12_24_18-scaled.jpg?resize=758%2C290&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"758\" height=\"290\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/The_North_York_Mirror_1975_12_24_18-scaled.jpg?w=2560&amp;ssl=1 2560w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/The_North_York_Mirror_1975_12_24_18-scaled.jpg?resize=300%2C115&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/The_North_York_Mirror_1975_12_24_18-scaled.jpg?resize=1024%2C391&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/The_North_York_Mirror_1975_12_24_18-scaled.jpg?resize=768%2C294&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/The_North_York_Mirror_1975_12_24_18-scaled.jpg?resize=1536%2C587&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/The_North_York_Mirror_1975_12_24_18-scaled.jpg?resize=2048%2C783&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/The_North_York_Mirror_1975_12_24_18-scaled.jpg?w=2274&amp;ssl=1 2274w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 758px) 100vw, 758px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>1978:\u00a0</strong>Bruce opens Night Two in Pittsburgh on the Darkness Tour with a world premiere: the as-yet-unreleased and still work-in-progress &#8220;Ramrod.&#8221;</p>\n<div id=\"v-qET8tGlm-1\" class=\"video-player\"><iframe title='VideoPress Video Player' aria-label='VideoPress Video Player' width='758' height='426' src='https://videopress.com/embed/qET8tGlm?hd=1&amp;cover=1&amp;loop=0&amp;autoPlay=0&amp;permalink=1&amp;muted=0&amp;controls=1&amp;playsinline=0&amp;useAverageColor=0&amp;preloadContent=metadata' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen data-resize-to-parent=\"true\" allow='clipboard-write; presentation'></iframe></div>\n<p><strong>1980:\u00a0</strong>Christmas may be over, but you&#8217;d never know it in Uniondale. Bruce opens his three-night, year-closing stand at the Nassau Coliseum by playing &#8220;Merry Christmas Baby&#8221; for the very first time. And that&#8217;s not the only world premiere at this show&#8211;toward the end of the first set, Bruce debuts his cover of &#8220;This Land is Your Land.&#8221; In the second set, Flo and Eddie guest star on &#8220;Hungry Heart.&#8221; &#8220;Because the Night&#8221; and &#8220;Hungry Heart&#8221; from this show will be officially released six years from now on <em>Live 1975-85.\u00a0</em>This show is available as part of Bruce&#8217;s official archive series.</p>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/seep_i99ydE?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/K7YhtgZeXsA?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Hwn4MTbI4k4?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<p><strong>1983:\u00a0</strong>Bruce makes a surprise appearance at La Bamba&#8217;s Holiday Hurrah benefit show for the Monmouth County chapter of Big Brothers.</p>\n<div id=\"v-roAY4OcD-1\" class=\"video-player\"><iframe title='VideoPress Video Player' aria-label='VideoPress Video Player' width='758' height='426' src='https://videopress.com/embed/roAY4OcD?hd=1&amp;cover=1&amp;loop=0&amp;autoPlay=0&amp;permalink=1&amp;muted=0&amp;controls=1&amp;playsinline=0&amp;useAverageColor=0&amp;preloadContent=metadata' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen data-resize-to-parent=\"true\" allow='clipboard-write; presentation'></iframe></div>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"71425\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/index.php/2025/12/28/kingdom-of-days-december-28-2/the_courier_news_1984_01_07_page_21/#main\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/The_Courier_News_1984_01_07_Page_21-scaled.jpg?fit=2560%2C1874&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"2560,1874\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"The_Courier_News_1984_01_07_Page_21\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/The_Courier_News_1984_01_07_Page_21-scaled.jpg?fit=758%2C555&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-71425\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/The_Courier_News_1984_01_07_Page_21-scaled.jpg?resize=758%2C555&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"758\" height=\"555\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/The_Courier_News_1984_01_07_Page_21-scaled.jpg?w=2560&amp;ssl=1 2560w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/The_Courier_News_1984_01_07_Page_21-scaled.jpg?resize=300%2C220&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/The_Courier_News_1984_01_07_Page_21-scaled.jpg?resize=1024%2C750&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/The_Courier_News_1984_01_07_Page_21-scaled.jpg?resize=768%2C562&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/The_Courier_News_1984_01_07_Page_21-scaled.jpg?resize=1536%2C1124&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/The_Courier_News_1984_01_07_Page_21-scaled.jpg?resize=2048%2C1499&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/The_Courier_News_1984_01_07_Page_21-scaled.jpg?w=2274&amp;ssl=1 2274w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 758px) 100vw, 758px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>1998:\u00a0</strong>Bruce joins Mike Ness in the studio in Los Angeles, lending his vocals and guitar on &#8220;Misery Loves Company.&#8221;</p>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/AaF2pZcVFKA?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<p><strong>2008: </strong>Bruce releases &#8220;Life Itself,&#8221; the second advance single from his upcoming <em>Working on a Dream.</em></p>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Pk8KPdWgAJY?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<p><strong>2017:\u00a0</strong>Patti Scialfa is sick with the flu, so Bruce continues playing the &#8220;B&#8221; setlist at\u00a0<em>Springsteen on Broadway\u00a0</em>at the Walter Kerr Theater in New York City.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n", "protected": false}, "excerpt": {"rendered": "<p>&#8220;Merry Christmas Baby,&#8221; &#8220;This Land Is Your Land&#8221; and a work-in-progress &#8220;Ramrod&#8221; all made their live debut on this date. Plus: Bruce joins Mike Ness in the studio, Earth&#8217;s biggest show, and more.</p>\n", "protected": false}, "author": 1, "featured_media": 31746, "comment_status": "open", "ping_status": "open", "stic